A list of all found '''glitches''' in The Battle Cats. Due to the nature of the subject, it is unlikely that every glitch in the game's history is included here, so feel free to report new glitches that have not been listed on this page.

==Energy Glitch==
The "Energy Glitch" allows the user to refill their energy by changing the device's date.
This glitch was patched in the [[Version 5.0 Update]]. However, it can still be performed to get out of recovery mode.

