==HGT Error==
This error will occur if the players change date/time. The game will be in [[Recovery Mode]] and the players can't access to Special Events, Cat Capsules and Login Bonus can't be received. You just have to go to the day and hit auto time then move it up a day then you can access special events.

==HGT02 False Error==
The game gives you a false error after accidentally detecting a time change on your device, which happens in the rare gacha section (it might also happen in other places though) but keeps the text underneath the banner image. However, the banner image disappears, showing what seems to be the rare gacha sprite in plain sight. This can be triggered by not opening the app for several days when your device is connected to the internet. It can usually be fixed by exiting the rare gacha section with the internet connected, though sometimes you may need to exit to the main menu or even restart the app entirely for it to fix itself.
