==Synced Metal Killer Attacks==
When the [[Metal Killer]] ability was first introduced, Cats with it could be stacked and synchronized to all deal damage based the amount of health that their target(s) had before being attacked. This was quickly patched to make it so that synced attacks would instead be applied successively, which dramatically lowered the ability's damage output when used in such a manner.

